1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:01,650
(Sheldon(exiting while the door is open):)Finally.

2
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:18,430
(Sheldon(exiting while the door is open):)Oh, what fresh hell is this?

3
00:00:18,430 --> 00:00:21,170
(Doctor:)Wait, you can't leave here,
you've been exposed.

4
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:25,740
(Sheldon:)No, I haven't.

5
00:00:25,740 --> 00:00:28,610
(Sheldon:)It's all good.

6
00:00:30,210 --> 00:00:33,180
(Penny:)You want to talk
about crazy mothers,

7
00:00:33,180 --> 00:00:35,880
(Penny:)Leonard's mom wouldn't give him
any sort of approval growing up.

8
00:00:35,880 --> 00:00:37,310
(Priya:)Oh, the poor thing.

9
00:00:37,320 --> 00:00:39,580
(Penny:)It makes him desperate
to please women.

10
00:00:39,580 --> 00:00:41,790
(Penny:)That's why the foreplay
goes on and on.

11
00:00:41,790 --> 00:00:44,090
(Priya:)It does, doesn't it?

12
00:00:44,090 --> 00:00:46,620
(Penny:)It's like he's
trying to win a prize.

13
00:00:46,630 --> 00:00:48,230
(Penny:)A word of advice--
don't doze off.

14
00:00:48,230 --> 00:00:50,660
(Penny:)You will never hear
the end of it.

15
00:00:50,660 --> 00:00:52,500
(Sheldon(through glass door pane):)Help me!

16
00:00:52,500 --> 00:00:54,230
(Sheldon(through glass door pane):)Come back!

17
00:00:54,230 --> 00:00:56,020
(Sheldon(through glass door pane):)Penny!

